WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.085 --> 00:00:05.140
Roxy flew away from the angry crowd.

2
00:00:05.141 --> 00:00:10.166
Her watch beeped.

3
00:00:10.167 --> 00:00:14.078
"Detective Smith," Roxy said. "What's up?"

4
00:00:14.079 --> 00:00:16.826
"I'm out of jail," Detective Smith said.

5
00:00:16.827 --> 00:00:20.328
"Another officer found video from a traffic camera.

6
00:00:20.329 --> 00:00:23.674
It shows that you didn't blow up the car."

7
00:00:23.675 --> 00:00:26.237
Roxy smiled. "Whew!"

8
00:00:26.238 --> 00:00:28.856
The detective cleared his throat.

9
00:00:28.857 --> 00:00:31.844
"The Tattle Twins have another emergency."

10
00:00:31.845 --> 00:00:33.731
Roxy rolled her eyes.

11
00:00:33.732 --> 00:00:38.354
"I was just there. They didn't have an emergency."

12
00:00:38.355 --> 00:00:42.241
"They said they do now," Detective Smith said.

13
00:00:42.242 --> 00:00:49.201
Roxy sighed. "Okay."

14
00:00:49.202 --> 00:00:52.914
*** Outside 100 West Street, Roxy used her super

15
00:00:52.915 --> 00:00:56.059
hearing. "Give us the money in the safe!" a man

16
00:00:56.060 --> 00:01:00.582
said. "Uh-oh," Roxy thought. "There is an emergency!"

17
00:01:00.583 --> 00:01:03.573
"There's no money," Pam said.

18
00:01:03.574 --> 00:01:06.823
"The safe is empty," Cam said.

19
00:01:06.824 --> 00:01:09.522
Roxy flew into the twins' apartment.

20
00:01:09.523 --> 00:01:12.529
Three mean-looking men held crowbars.

21
00:01:12.530 --> 00:01:17.055
"Rocket Girl!" Pam said. "I'm glad you're here!"

22
00:01:17.056 --> 00:01:20.135
Cam nodded. "So glad!"

23
00:01:20.136 --> 00:01:22.498
The man with the beard grinned.

24
00:01:22.499 --> 00:01:26.643
"Rocket Girl! Help us break open that safe!"

25
00:01:26.644 --> 00:01:29.222
"Huh?" Roxy was confused.

26
00:01:29.223 --> 00:01:33.323
"You're a bad guy now, right?" another man said.

27
00:01:33.324 --> 00:01:35.293
Roxy was shocked.

28
00:01:35.294 --> 00:01:37.577
But she had an idea.

29
00:01:37.578 --> 00:01:40.372
"Actually, yes." She smiled.

30
00:01:40.373 --> 00:01:42.897
"I'm a bad guy now."

31
00:01:42.898 --> 00:01:46.426
Pam and Cam gasped.

32
00:01:46.427 --> 00:01:49.172
"Give me your crowbars," Roxy said.

33
00:01:49.173 --> 00:01:51.994
"I'll break open the safe."

34
00:01:51.995 --> 00:01:55.560
Pam huffed. "There's no money."

35
00:01:55.561 --> 00:01:59.568
"The safe is empty!" Cam said.

36
00:01:59.569 --> 00:02:03.605
The man with the beard handed his crowbar to Roxy.

37
00:02:03.606 --> 00:02:06.990
Roxy quickly twisted it around his wrists.

38
00:02:06.991 --> 00:02:10.763
"Hey!" The man struggled to move his arms.

39
00:02:10.764 --> 00:02:12.553
"What's going on?"

40
00:02:12.554 --> 00:02:15.762
"You're under arrest!" Roxy said.

41
00:02:15.763 --> 00:02:18.102
The other two men ran toward Roxy.

42
00:02:18.103 --> 00:02:20.703
She used her heat vision on the crowbars.

43
00:02:20.704 --> 00:02:24.820
"Ouch!" The men dropped the hot crowbars.

44
00:02:24.821 --> 00:02:28.140
"We give up!"

45
00:02:28.141 --> 00:02:31.685
"Thanks, Rocket Girl." Pam stared at the floor.

46
00:02:31.686 --> 00:02:34.851
"We're sorry for what we did."

47
00:02:34.852 --> 00:02:39.254
Cam nodded. "We just wanted to be famous."

48
00:02:39.255 --> 00:02:42.768
Roxy frowned. "You made me look like a bad guy.

49
00:02:42.769 --> 00:02:46.938
And making fake videos that harm people is against the law. You're

50
00:02:46.939 --> 00:02:50.429
going to have to pay a big fine." Pam

51
00:02:50.430 --> 00:02:54.211
gulped. "We won't do it again." Cam

52
00:02:54.212 --> 00:02:59.091
nodded. "We lost all of our followers." "Really?"

53
00:02:59.092 --> 00:03:02.770
Roxy scratched her head. ***

54
00:03:02.771 --> 00:03:10.877
Roxy brought the men to jail and returned to the theater.

55
00:03:10.878 --> 00:03:12.263
She whispered to Terrell.

56
00:03:12.264 --> 00:03:16.044
"The Tattle Twins lost all of their followers."

57
00:03:16.045 --> 00:03:18.387
"I know," Terrell whispered.

58
00:03:18.388 --> 00:03:23.285
"I commented on their last video. I said it looked totally fake.

59
00:03:23.286 --> 00:03:25.782
My comment got thousands of 'likes.'

60
00:03:25.783 --> 00:03:27.850
Other people said it looked fake too.

61
00:03:27.851 --> 00:03:31.593
The Tattle Twins' follower count went down fast!"

62
00:03:31.594 --> 00:03:38.867
Roxy chuckled. "Thanks, Terrell!"

